53	const FAQ = [
54	  { q: "How does billing work across products?", a: "Every Nxeon product — VPS, game servers, shared hosting, business email and domains — is prepaid from your wallet balance, monthly by default. VPS also offers optional annual and multi-year terms at a discount. Whatever term you choose, services auto-renew at exactly that same price — the price you sign up at is the price you renew at — and nothing locks you in: cancel anytime and billing stops at the end of the current period." },
55	  { q: "Is the first month really free?", a: "On shared web hosting, yes — your first month is on us, then the plan renews at exactly the regular monthly price you see. The free-month offer applies to shared hosting only; VPS, game servers, business email and domains bill their regular price from month one." },
